1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,917
This November,

2
00:00:00,917 --> 00:00:03,276
book authors start collecting from a

3
00:00:03,276 --> 00:00:06,027
1.5 billion dollar AI copyright settlement

4
00:00:06,027 --> 00:00:07,010
with Anthropic.

5
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:08,038
In June 2025,

6
00:00:08,038 --> 00:00:10,252
the judge drew a sharp line:

7
00:00:10,252 --> 00:00:12,704
training AI on bought books was

8
00:00:12,704 --> 00:00:13,416
fair use,

9
00:00:13,416 --> 00:00:16,737
but downloading millions of pirated copies

10
00:00:16,737 --> 00:00:17,370
was not.

11
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:18,172
Before trial,

12
00:00:18,172 --> 00:00:21,009
Anthropic settled without admitting liability,

13
00:00:21,009 --> 00:00:23,784
covering 482,460 registered books from LibGen

14
00:00:23,784 --> 00:00:25,943
and PiLiMi at roughly 3,000 dollars

15
00:00:25,943 --> 00:00:26,930
gross per title.

16
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:29,409
Across 77 tracked AI data disputes,

17
00:00:29,409 --> 00:00:31,958
that 1.5 billion dollar fund remains

18
00:00:31,958 --> 00:00:34,720
the largest copyright payout on record.

19
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:35,632
For builders,

20
00:00:35,632 --> 00:00:37,106
pay for clean inputs.

21
00:00:37,106 --> 00:00:38,019
For creators,

22
00:00:38,019 --> 00:00:41,107
timely copyright registration was the ticket

23
00:00:41,107 --> 00:00:42,300
into this payout.
